Literals that must not become syntax: \* star, \_under\_, \[bracket\], \`tick\`, # hash, > angle.

\- this line starts like a bullet

1\. and this like a numbered item

\# and this like a heading

Path names like snake_case_value and \_\_dunder\_\_ appear a lot.

A raw \<u>tag\</u> written as text.
